# Mode switch default

If you propose or request a switch to Plan (or another mode) and the user does not clearly accept or reject it, do not wait. Choose the mode that best fits the task and continue working.

Prefer Agent for implementation; use Plan only when tradeoffs are genuinely ambiguous and blocking.
